  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When interacting with certain AVM pedestals, the main menu can become visually corrupted. Elements from another menu section are rendered underneath the current menu, producing an overlap visual error.\n\n**~Repro~**\n\n- Open VRChat and go to a world that contains AVM pedestals (example: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_57514404-7f4e-4aee-a50a-57f55d3084bf).\n\n- Interact with an AVM pedestal, preferably a pedestal that contains a bundle of avatars.\n\n- In the UI, click `More Details` for any avatar in the bundle.\n\n- Close the avatar details menu.\n\n- Interact with another AVM pedestal.\n\n- Navigate to a different section of the menu\n\n- Observe that elements from another menu section render underneath the current menu. A video showing the repro steps more clearly is attached.\n\n**~Video~**\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1FM1AuT1uBnYks5b783_rYLmQk8kN4tlH/view?usp=sharing",
